{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>特色口味:大紅袍花椒/荔枝碧螺春</p><p>人氣雪糕品牌TEEMTONEfai上環開店！</p><p>創業十周年的本地人氣創意雪糕品牌 TEEMTONEfai(甜筒暉)，最近於上環摩羅上街開設實體店。新店不僅貫徹品牌一貫的懷舊玩味風格，更帶來多款注入中式及本地情懷與的全新口味，為雪糕迷帶來與別不同的體驗！</p><p>中式茗茶/辛香料主題全新口味雪糕！</p><p>慶祝十周年實體店開幕，店主Thomas 特別研發了一系列全新口味，將中式茗茶、辛香料及香港人喜歡的食材製作冰涼軟滑的雪糕，其中包括全新茶味系列——荔枝碧螺春、焦糖蘋果大紅袍、白桃烏龍，為炎炎夏日增添涼爽快感！</p><p>多款全新特色雪葩！</p><p>另外仲有全新川辛及滋補系列——海鹽青花椒、大紅袍川花椒黑芝麻、紅棗紫米；全新特色雪葩 ：檸檬甘草薑茶雪葩、野菜蜜椰青雪葩、野莓燈籠椒雪葩，超多款特色雪糕任你揀！</p><p>TEEMTONEfai 官方IG：@teemtonefai</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178711236355516718_5442872066a852bacbb9ea.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178711236671518912_8666952606a852baf4dd1a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178711236921142834_6314522096a852bb1b71d0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17871123717221899_4391043306a852bb457d39.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178711237467342301_8769476126a852bb720c73.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178711237693537933_6276390076a852bb97846f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178711237916490329_318329446a852bbbd0cf7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178711238130438925_1390143046a852bbdbc060.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178711238328162823_12513662016a852bc0292d7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T04:20:38.027761+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":463,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}